b/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_Bibliophile_ManuscriptNotes01</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Bibliophile_ManuscriptNotes01\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Bibliophile_ManuscriptNotes01\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">22c44acd-a467-4acc-88a4-946a239fc526</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:22c44acd-a467-4acc-88a4-946a239fc526\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:22c44acd-a467-4acc-88a4-946a239fc526\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a locked chest on the first floor of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Bibliophile\" title=\"The Bibliophile\">The Bibliophile</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-105&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-121</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Protagonists:\n</p><p><br>\nJonathan Allez\n</p><p>Born and raised in the quiet town of Emin, Jonathan dreamed of escaping the work-a-day routine of school, work, and leisure. But Jonathan sought something beyond a life of adventure or travel; he wanted to create the worlds of his own imagination.\n</p><p><br>\nJennifer Vallen\n</p><p>Reared in the northerly lands of Bos, Jennifer was fascinated with the natural world - its creatures, physics, and mysteries yet to be discovered. Though she excelled in alchemy, she couldn't shake the feeling that there was a key truth still waiting just beyond reach of the natural world as she knew it.\n</p><p><br>\nDragonson\n</p><p>A great worg-hound twice the size of his littermates, Dragonson set out in search of a worthy companion for his travels. Fears nothing in all the realm, except for treessyms.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/First_Draft_-_Story\" title=\"First Draft - Story\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/First_Draft_-_Story\" title=\"First Draft - Story\">First Draft - Story</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/First_Draft_-_World\" title=\"First Draft - World\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Book_Note_G_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/First_Draft_-_World\" title=\"First Draft - World\">First Draft - World</a></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715060316\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2100/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33830/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10634/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1097913/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.554      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   52.554      1 -total\n 38.01%   19.977      6 Template:Icon_text\n 36.12%   18.981     27 Template:Trim\n 23.50%   12.349      2 Template:MdRarityItem\n 18.82%    9.893      2 Template:Item_icon\n 17.87%    9.392      2 Te